description:
The append option of the dbWriteTable seems not to work correctly.
When I tried to append the data to the existed table with the append=T option, I got a failure.

The code is below:
if(dbExistsTable(conn, 'mytable')) {
     dbWriteTable(conn, 'mytable', data, row.names = F, append = T, overwrite = F)
 } else {
       dbWriteTable(conn, 'mytable', data, row.names = F)
}

